{'symbol': 'TRV', 'date': '2023-04-13 09:00:00', 'title': 'TRAVELERS INSTITUTE® TO HOST CYBERSECURITY SYMPOSIUM IN PORTLAND, OREGON', 'text': 'PORTLAND, ORE.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--THE TRAVELERS INSTITUTE, THE PUBLIC POLICY DIVISION OF THE TRAVELERS COMPANIES, INC. (NYSE: TRV), WILL HOST ITS IN-PERSON CYBER: PREPARE, PREVENT, MITIGATE, RESTORE® SYMPOSIUM MONDAY, APRIL 17, IN PORTLAND. THE SOLD-OUT EVENT, WHICH IS PART OF A NATIONAL SERIES, PROMOTES DIALOGUE AND EDUCATION AROUND HELPING BUSINESSES PREPARE FOR, AND RESPOND TO, CYBER INCIDENTS.'}